    "updated_at": "2021-10-26T20:48:01Z",
    "body": "Another way this can happen is if an intermediate empty group is removed.  For example:\r\n\r\n  `(foo){}*`\r\n\r\nCurrently becomes:\r\n\r\n  `(foo)*`\r\n\r\nBut should be:\r\n\r\n  `(foo)(.*)`",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/urlpattern/issues/comments/952313056/reactions",
