    "body": "Another way generating strings can change the meaning... This:\r\n\r\n  `{:k\\\\A}`\r\n\r\nBecomes:\r\n\r\n  `{:kA}`\r\n\r\nWhich changes from a named `:k` group with a suffix `A` to a single named `:kA` group.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
